WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:15.967
Roxy hurried out of Mara's house.

2
00:00:15.967 --> 00:00:18.749
"Listen, guys," she said.

3
00:00:18.749 --> 00:00:21.066
"I have to—"

4
00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:25.700
"Practice throwing a Frisbee?" said Terrell.

5
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:30.321
He tossed the Frisbee to Roxy again.

6
00:00:30.322 --> 00:00:35.517
"Ha-ha!" Roxy pretended to laugh as the Frisbee dropped onto the grass.

7
00:00:35.517 --> 00:00:38.125
"First I have to run home," she said.

8
00:00:38.125 --> 00:00:49.077
"I forgot to, um, feed my goldfish!"

9
00:00:49.078 --> 00:00:53.440
A minute later Roxy was soaring over downtown Metro City.

10
00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:57.745
West Street was filled with smashed cars and buses.

11
00:00:57.744 --> 00:01:01.641
Roxy saw enormous footprints in the street.

12
00:01:01.641 --> 00:01:06.220
They pointed in every direction.

13
00:01:06.221 --> 00:01:11.605
"It looks like a giant lizard made those footprints," thought Roxy.

14
00:01:11.606 --> 00:01:14.879
Detective Smith stood near a huge pile of bricks.

15
00:01:14.879 --> 00:01:17.171
There was a broken sign in the pile.

16
00:01:17.171 --> 00:01:22.142
The sign read "Quick Mart."

17
00:01:22.143 --> 00:01:26.800
Roxy smiled. "Why did you knock down Quick Mart, Detective?

18
00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:29.626
Were they out of coffee?"

19
00:01:29.627 --> 00:01:32.292
"Very funny, Rocket Girl."

20
00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:34.256
Detective Smith frowned.

21
00:01:34.257 --> 00:01:36.953
"I didn't knock down Quick Mart.

22
00:01:36.953 --> 00:01:40.177
A huge monster stepped on it."

23
00:01:40.178 --> 00:01:42.520
Roxy looked around.

24
00:01:42.520 --> 00:01:45.470
"I see the monster's footprints.

25
00:01:45.471 --> 00:01:48.316
But where is the monster now?"

26
00:01:48.316 --> 00:01:50.280
The detective shrugged.

27
00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:52.178
"I just got here.

28
00:01:52.179 --> 00:01:55.783
The monster was already gone when I arrived."

29
00:01:55.783 --> 00:01:58.783
A woman ran over.

30
00:01:58.783 --> 00:02:01.239
"The monster went south."

31
00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:03.071
She pointed down the street.

32
00:02:03.072 --> 00:02:07.154
Then she looked across the street and sighed.

33
00:02:07.154 --> 00:02:09.179
"I'm a gardener.

34
00:02:09.179 --> 00:02:11.704
I was here to weed the public garden.

35
00:02:11.704 --> 00:02:13.486
But it's ruined."

36
00:02:13.487 --> 00:02:16.795
"And so is my car!" said an angry man.

37
00:02:16.794 --> 00:02:20.690
He was walking over to Detective Smith and Roxy.

38
00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:23.959
"The monster stepped on it!"

39
00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:28.808
"The monster stepped on my bus!" said a bus driver.

40
00:02:28.807 --> 00:02:31.238
Another man ran over.

41
00:02:31.238 --> 00:02:33.220
"This is an outrage!

42
00:02:33.221 --> 00:02:36.839
That monster tore the roof off my flower store.

43
00:02:36.839 --> 00:02:39.979
Then it ate all my flowers!"

44
00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:44.456
"The monster ate the flowers?" asked Detective Smith.

45
00:02:44.457 --> 00:02:47.574
He took out his notepad and started writing.

46
00:02:47.573 --> 00:02:49.055
The gardener blinked.

47
00:02:49.055 --> 00:02:53.371
"I saw the monster eat all the flowers in the garden too!"

48
00:02:53.372 --> 00:02:56.658
The man from the flower store was still angry.

49
00:02:56.659 --> 00:02:58.158
He looked at Roxy.

50
00:02:58.158 --> 00:03:01.298
"What are you going to do about this, Rocket Girl?"

51
00:03:01.298 --> 00:03:03.034
Roxy held up her hands.

52
00:03:03.035 --> 00:03:07.746
"Relax. I will find the monster and stop it."

53
00:03:07.747 --> 00:03:09.953
She looked at the gardener.

54
00:03:09.953 --> 00:03:13.378
"You said the monster went south, right?"

55
00:03:13.378 --> 00:03:15.628
"Yes," said the gardener.

56
00:03:15.628 --> 00:03:18.954
"That's where the Metro City Convention Center is.

57
00:03:18.955 --> 00:03:24.932
I was actually going to go there later today because—" She gulped.

58
00:03:24.932 --> 00:03:27.774
"What's wrong?" asked Roxy.

59
00:03:27.775 --> 00:03:32.987
"I know why the monster went toward the convention center," said the gardener.

60
00:03:32.987 --> 00:03:40.713
"There's a huge flower show today!"
